# Stacked Bottom Sheet — a provider that stacks trays from the bottom: each
# "Show stacked tray" press pushes a new tray (heights 140..350), older trays
# scale down and peek above; only the front tray is draggable and a downward
# drag dismisses it. The third tray has a 🪄 button that pushes a fixed-key
# "the-magic" tray rendering the Spiral (Skia) demo.
# What this test covers: pushing several trays (stacking/scale/opacity of the
# ones behind), dismissing by dragging down, an upward drag past 50pt (springs
# back), a short upward drag (see report: dismisses because the end threshold
# is `translationY > -50`), the 🪄 magic tray, dismissing it and re-pushing the
# same fixed key twice in a row, pushing beyond the last config (reuses 350),
# and dismissing everything.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/stacked-bottom-sheet"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait "text" "SHOW STACKED TRAY" 10000
wait 800
press 201 427
wait 1200
press 201 427
wait 1500
wait "text" "Let's add a bit of magic" 3000
# Magic tray (Spiral) on top.
press 309 734
wait 2500
# Dismiss it by dragging down; the wand tray is in front again.
gesture pan 201 700 0 120 300
wait 1500
# Push the fixed-key magic tray twice quickly.
press 309 734 --count 2 --interval-ms 60
wait 2500
gesture pan 201 700 0 120 300
wait 1500
# Upward drag past -50: must spring back and keep the tray.
gesture pan 201 760 0 -120 500
wait 1500
# Push more trays than there are configs (last one is reused).
press 201 427
wait 800
press 201 427
wait 800
press 201 427
wait 800
press 201 427
wait 800
press 201 427
wait 1500
# Dismiss the front trays one by one with downward drags.
gesture pan 201 700 0 150 300
wait 1200
gesture pan 201 700 0 150 300
wait 1200
gesture pan 201 700 0 150 300
wait 1200
# Short upward flick on the front tray.
gesture pan 201 760 0 -30 300
wait 1500
wait "text" "SHOW STACKED TRAY" 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
